</i></c>

00:05:46.309 --> 00:05:48.380 line:64%
<c.cyan><i>Have a good journey home,</i></c>

00:05:48.380 --> 00:05:52.493 position:58% line:68%
<c.cyan><i>and we'll see you back here next year
on the streets of Bridgwater,</i></c>

00:05:52.493 --> 00:05:56.290 line:68%
